  <scopecontent id="c3ebaf0ca84665d22bc78aa6c364e8b5">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Photographs are from John H. Janney's time working in the International Health Division. They show Janney and other IHD staff at gatherings and meetings in Romania and Chile.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <acqinfo id="0a489bdf818ea00b9f4c5dabddfe6892">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The photographs of John H. Janney were deposited with The Rockefeller Foundation Archives by John H. Janney.</p>  </acqinfo>
